content:
Ibulayimu n’azaala Isaaka;
    batabani ba Isaaka baali
    Esawu ne Isirayiri.

Akiyezeeri ye yali omukulu, muganda we Yowaasi n’amuddirira, bombi nga batabani ba Semaa Omugibeya;
    Yeziyeri ne Pereti batabani ba Azumavesi;
    Beraka, ne Yeeku Omwanasoni,

Muyimusize Mukama ekitiibwa ekigwanira erinnya lye;
  muleete ekiweebwayo, mujje mu maaso ge;
    musinze Mukama mu kitiibwa ky’obutukuvu bwe.

Bazzukulu ba Leevi abalala baali:

    okuva mu batabani ba Amulaamu, yali Subayeri;
    okuva mu batabani ba Subayeri yali Yedeya.

Abataka ab’ebika bya Isirayiri baali:

    eyafuganga Abalewubeeni yali Eryeza mutabani wa Zikuli;
    eyafuganga Abasimyoni yali Sefatiya mutabani wa Maaka;

Bano be baana Dawudi be yazaalira mu Kebbulooni:

    Omuggulanda ye yali Amunoni gwe yazaala mu Akinoamu Omuyezuleeri;
    owookubiri ye yali Danyeri gwe yazaala mu Abbigayiri Omukalumeeri;

Bazzukulu ba Kokasi baali
    Amminadaabu mutabani we, Koola muzzukulu we,
    Assiri muzzukulu we;
